:{"slug":"skybuster_soda_sour_and_spicy","name":"Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy).webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Shake the bottle vigorously for three hundred seconds then pry the cap open according to the instructions, and it will shoot into the sky with immense force. Don't worry, the bottle is made of high-toughness acrylic that will not break easily.\nThe soda inside is a strong sour and spicy flavor. Do not open indoors.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":400,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"powerful_balloon":{"slug":"powerful_balloon","name":"Powerful Balloon","icon":"/enemies-icons/Powerful Balloon.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"One of many powerful hot-air balloons that comprise the first levitating plate on Terra.\nTurn the technological legacy of the Ring Lab into children's toys, and balloons for children into a levitating plate's source of power. That is the Columbian way.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter","Grants 1 Buoyancy when on a Levitatable Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"high_powered_skyhowl_vacuum":{"slug":"high_powered_skyhowl_vacuum","name":"High-Powered Skyhowl Vacuum","icon":"/enemies-icons/High-Powered Skyhowl Vacuum.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Merely vacuuming the ceiling isn't enough of a se